<title>USA: North European Oil sets distribution.</title>
<headline>North European Oil sets distribution.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>North European Oil Royalty Trust set a quarterly distribution of $0.36 a share payable August 27 to holders of record August 15.</p>
<p>The distribution last quarter was $0.39 a share.</p>
</text>
